le":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kyman201</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1415511-poorly-describe-your-exalted-characters?p=1415644#post1415644\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">1. A stupid smart person who genuinely believed his home's propaganda, is now taking exception to how they don't actually live up to the image.<br /> <br /> 2. One Toasty Lady sword good.<br /> <br /> 3. A Disney Princess gone horribly wrong.<br /> <br /> 4. The Potential Sister of Toasty Lady in #2 got Actually Born, and wants a reunion.<br /> <br /> 5. A character I realized two years after I made her represents my issues with my mom, with Hell Powers.<br /> <br /> 6-10. A Quirky Office Sitcom cast, but the Office is Yu Shan.<br /> <br /> 11. Some Exalts make Warstriders and Daiklaves. This one makes dinner.<br /> <br /> 12. &amp;quot;What if I take a character concept first used as a smut extra and gave her personality?&amp;quot;<br /> <br /> 13. Himbo serial flirt who's also a shark.<br /> <br /> Special Mentions: A number of characters who are Literally Anime/Cartoon/Video Game Characters. Like, down to the name. I'm not being subtle. Additionally: A larger number of characters who are <i>basically</i> expies but I at least changed the name.</div> </div> </div> </div>If I ever play Exalted I wanna hang out with your characters lol<br /> <br /> One character I thought about playing if my group ever does Exalted is a Dragon-Blooded officer from House Tepet who goes adventuring to redeem her clan\u2019s honor after the battle with the Bull of the North. Her boyfriend (an NPC, NOT the person her family expects her to marry) 